         "sym": "625"
        },
        {
         "tex": "25^2 &= 625",
         "sym": "25**2"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "title": "Use Theorem 15",
       "lines": [
        {
         "text": "$|AB|^2 + |BC|^2 = |AC|^2$, so by the converse of Pythagoras the angle opposite $|AC|$ is a right angle."
